  "title": {
   "en": "Yotogi no Akujo - Hatsujou Taishitsu Reijou wa, Yorugoto Koutei ni Aisareru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "夜伽の悪女 ～発情体質令嬢は、夜ごと皇帝に愛される～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The nights of the villainous woman"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“What’s Happening to Me…?”\nCarol, a young woman, enters the imperial palace as one of the candidates to marry the young emperor—hoping to save her family from financial ruin.\nBut the moment she lays eyes on the emperor during the ceremony, a strange, burning wave surges through her body.\n\nAs events unfold, she grows closer to him… only to discover that the emperor secretly harbors a deep hatred toward her.\nDespite being on opposing sides, the two find themselves unable to resist the fiery passion pulling them together.\n\nA thrilling fantasy romance set in a majestic imperial world, where the line between hatred and desire is put to the ultimate test."
  },
